          "text": "🇫🇷 Today we remember #LeonBlum, who passed away 75 years ago. Serving as French Prime Minister - and leading the Front Populaire government in the 1930s - Blum advanced concrete measures that benefited workers, such as the 40h-week and the 2-week paid holiday.\nHis words resonate to this day: to guarantee freedom to its people, a society must first ensure their access to essential goods and fundamental rights.\n\n@partisocialiste"
